          deckDescription: 'A 30-card pack made by stripping a standard 52-card French deck: all cards from 2 through 6 are removed except the 7 of hearts and 7 of spades, so that ranks 7 through Ace remain. There are four suits; the exact composition gives 30 cards for three players in Teen Do Panch.',
          suitDescription: 'The four French suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades) are used; from the high ranks (7 to Ace) each suit has seven cards, except that only two 7s are kept (hearts and spades) so the total is 30 cards across the four suits.',
